00:36:47.600 --> 00:36:51.470
of your paper what
it might be like

00:36:51.470 --> 00:36:55.100
and how helpful it
might be to imagine

00:36:55.100 --> 00:37:00.920
a second track of negotiations
convened by the US

00:37:00.920 --> 00:37:04.040
governors and the
